    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-55981",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-23T06:47:05.745Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-23T06:47:05.745Z",
      "description": "A firmware verification vulnerability in Creative Sound\nBlaster Katana could allow an attacker to modify a legitimate firmware image\nand upload the modified firmware to an affected device.",
      "severity": 9.6,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Creative Labs Creative Sound Blaster Katana V2, V2X, SE\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/alerts-and-advisories/alerts/al-2026-134/",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
