      "description": "An\nauthentication vulnerability in the Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) implementation\nof Creative Sound Blaster Katana could allow an attacker within Bluetooth range\nto connect to an affected device without prior pairing or authentication.",
      "severity": 4.3,
